## Scope

Keyword/semantic search, advanced filters/autocomplete, authenticated tracking, search history/saved filters/alerts, detail/export/rating/similar/report/delete history.

## Acceptance criteria

- Public results only include published content and safe fields.
- Tracking requires dossier code plus allowed verification data.
- Search history and alerts are private to the user.
- Batch export applies the same visibility rules as the result list.

